 <h3><u>Wah hamshakle nabi</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span data-ft={ tn:k} class=userContent>Wah hamshakle nabi.....x4<br> <br> Akbar jamaal kudrat e parwardigar hai<br> Akbar khudai husn ka aaina daar hai.<br> Laila ka maan ibne Ali ka waqaar hai.<br> khaaliq ko jispe naaz ye wo shahkar hai.<br> Jiska nahi jawab ye wo lajawab hai.<br> Ye hubahu shabih e risalat ma'aab hai.<span class=text_exposed_show><br> <br> Wah hamshakle nabi.....x4<br> <br> Ho iske rubaru bhala kya daaghdaar chaand<br> Muh abr me chhupake chale barbar chaand<br> Waise muhavre me to hote hai chaar chaand<br> Akbar ne karbala ko lagaye hazaar chaand<br> Paya hai chehra misle payambar isiliye<br> Rakha gaya hai naam bhi akbar isiliye<br> <br> Wah hamshakle nabi.....x4<br> <br> Naa subho hai naa raat barabar ka waqt hai<br> Ibne Ali ke mehre munawwar ka waqt hai<br> Tafseer surah e rukhe anwar ka waqt hai<br> Ye zikr hazrat e ali akbar ka waqt hai<br> Tauqeer badrahi hai dar e buturaab ki<br> Aamad hai phir jahaa'n me risalat ma'aab ki<br> <br> Wah hamshakle nabi.....x4<br> <br> Shabbir ko wirasat e khairul wara mili<br> Abbas ko shuja'at e shere khuda mili<br> Qasim ko azmate hasan e mujtaba mili<br> Is ghar me shaan sabko khuda se juda mili<br> Zainab ne paya rutba e aala batul ka<br> Akbar ko milgaya hai sarapa rasool ka<br> <br> Wah hamshakle nabi.....x4<br> <br> Gesu bhi noor chehra e tahir bhi noor hai<br> Paikar bhi noor sina e aamir bhi noor hai<br> Baatin bhi iska noor hai zaahir bhi noor hai<br> Hadh ye ke is qaseede ka shayar bhi noor hai<br> Beta mila hai aisa nirala husain ko<br> Hairat se dekhta hai ujala husain ko<br> <br> Wah hamshakle nabi.....x4<br> <br> Ab tazkera hai akbar e khushruh ki jang ka<br> Khaaro'n se dashte zaar me khushbu ki jang ka<br> Baazu e kirdigar ke baazu ki jang ka<br> Sar chad ke bolte hue jaadu ki jang ka<br> Nazre uthake dekha to har saf ulatgai<br> Khud maut iske pairo se aake lipatgai<br> <br> Wah hamshakle nabi.....x4<br> <br> Akbar ne tegh khaichi udhe beparo ke sar<br> Ki jab nigaha katgaye deedawaro ke sar<br> Zadpar ajal ki aaye jo fitnagaro ke sar<br> Shaano se khud hi girne lage khudsaro ke saro<br> Tha shor bhaago jang se haatho ko jhaadke<br> Lo aagaye Ali dar e khaibar ukhaadke<br> <br> Wah hamshakle nabi.....x4<br> <br> Manzar ye kaarzaar ka kaise karu bayaa'n<br> Akbar ki tegh aaj ajal ki hai tarjuma<br> Talwar ki chamak me tadapti hai bijliya'n<br> Khaime ke dar pe shah e zamana hai SHADMAA'N<br> Ulti sipah NOOR Ali uske baar ne<br> Uth uth ke daad di hai usey zulfiqar ne.<br> <br> Wah hamshakle nabi.....x4</span></span></p> 
